
Power Automate / Dataverse Returned to Rep Follow-Up Flow
================================================================

Purpose
-------
When an Opportunity had the status "Sq. Ft. $ Budget" and then gets updated to "Returned to Rep",
wait 3 months, then send an email every 90 days from the date the status was set to Returned to Rep.

Emails should be sent at:
- 90 days
- 180 days
- 270 days
- 360 days

Stop sending when:
- The Opportunity is no longer actively in Returned to Rep
- The Returned to Rep status has been set for more than 1 year

The flow uses the Opportunity Status Duration table:
- Table: ctp_opportunitystatuses
- Status text field: ctp_name
- Status start date: ctp_datestatusset
- Status end date: ctp_datestatusend
- Opportunity lookup: _ctp_opportunity_value

The email should:
- Be sent to the Sales Rep on the Account associated with the Opportunity
- Have the Opportunity set as Regarding
- Use this body:

Opportunities that were budgeted that are due to be followed up on.
Please update the status and add notes to the “Latest Update” field.


