============================================================
7. Condition: Previous status equals Sq. Ft. $ Budget
============================================================

Action name:
Condition

Left side expression:
if(greater(length(outputs('List_rows_2')?['body/value']),0),first(outputs('List_rows_2')?['body/value'])?['ctp_name'],'')

Operator:
is equal to

Right side:
Sq. Ft. $ Budget

Purpose:
This ensures the Opportunity came from Sq. Ft. $ Budget before going to Returned to Rep.

Put all remaining actions below inside the YES branch.


============================================================
8. Compose: DaysInReturnedToRep
============================================================

Action type:
Compose

Action name:
DaysInReturnedToRep

Expression:
int(
  div(
    sub(
      ticks(startOfDay(utcNow())),
      ticks(startOfDay(outputs('ReturnedToRepStart')))
    ),
    864000000000
  )
)

Purpose:
Calculates how many calendar days the Opportunity has been in Returned to Rep.

Why this version:
It uses startOfDay so the flow is not affected by the exact hour/minute when Returned to Rep was set.


============================================================
9. Compose: MilestoneDue
============================================================

Action type:
Compose

Action name:
MilestoneDue

Expression:
if(
  and(
    greaterOrEquals(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 360),
    lessOrEquals(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 365)
  ),
  360,
  if(
    and(
      greaterOrEquals(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 270),
      less(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 360)
    ),
    270,
    if(
      and(
        greaterOrEquals(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 180),
        less(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 270)
      ),
      180,
      if(
        and(
          greaterOrEquals(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 90),
          less(int(outputs('DaysInReturnedToRep')), 180)
        ),
        90,
        0
      )
    )
  )
)

Purpose:
Determines which reminder milestone is currently due.

Milestone behavior:
90–179 days   = 90-day email
180–269 days  = 180-day email
270–359 days  = 270-day email
360–365 days  = 360-day final email
Over 365 days = stop


