============================================================
FINAL FLOW ORDER INSIDE APPLY_TO_EACH
============================================================

OppId
ReturnedToRepStart
List_rows_2
Condition: previous status equals Sq. Ft. $ Budget
  YES:
    DaysInReturnedToRep
    MilestoneDue
    Condition_2: MilestoneDue greater than 0
      YES:
        EmailSubject
        Check_existing_milestone_email
        No_existing_milestone_email
          YES:
            Get_the_Opportunity
            Opportunity_has_Account
              YES:
                Get_a_row_by_ID
                Account_Sales_Rep_exists
                  YES:
                    Add_a_new_row
                    Perform_a_bound_action


============================================================
EXPECTED RESULT
============================================================

This flow will:
- Find Opportunities currently in Returned to Rep
- Confirm the previous status was Sq. Ft. $ Budget
- Count days from the Returned to Rep start date
- Send at 90, 180, 270, and 360 days
- Avoid duplicate milestone emails
- Stop when the status changes away from Returned to Rep
- Stop after the 1-year / 360-day reminder window
- Send to the Account Sales Rep
- Set the Opportunity as Regarding









